<p>American freelance journalist Shelly Kittleson was abducted in Baghdad on Tuesday, Iraqi officials and multiple news outlets said. Iraqi security forces launched a search for her captors, while US officials said they were aware of the case. Kittleson has reported for outlets including Al-Monitor, BBC, Foreign Policy and Politico, and colleagues described her as an experienced war-zone correspondent based in Rome. The case quickly drew international attention because it involves a US citizen and a journalist working in Iraq, where kidnappings and attacks by armed groups remain a serious security threat. US Assistant Secretary of State Dylan Johnson said one suspect in the abduction had ties to the Iran-aligned militia Kataib Hezbollah and was in Iraqi custody. Iraqi authorities said they were working to recover Kittleson safely.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/An1qa0QzqRoAoa4lnvxqCFlzzQgQlwSF5zxe0f6CAgYDT3n_6x_SuDD7yZEugYvyqyr9QXsWzh7EvzmTwtYF0Kq3eqHtvMAbpwgG9qxGwdckd9Srrr0N0N4K41WyrslBOr-qnLo61yJvPWQUkhZNhek7ZXgIuGl2Edsu9uiblAbMSrdAZciD8T9UBD1OL55buR8j3gEEtRVrylDqVtcfbnHeqtv5Y_tTu-LA' alt='American journalist Shelly Kittleson, who was reported kidnapped in Baghdad.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Daylight seizure: Al Jazeera said Kittleson was kidnapped in broad daylight on a Baghdad street, underscoring the brazenness of the operation.</li><li>Prior warning: The US State Department said it had previously warned Kittleson about threats and repeated its advisory that US citizens should avoid travel to Iraq.</li><li>Media appeals: Al-Monitor and the Committee to Protect Journalists called publicly for Kittleson’s immediate and safe release and urged Iraqi authorities to hold those responsible accountable.</li><li>Regional context: Euronews said it was not immediately clear whether the kidnapping was tied to the ongoing regional war, even as Iran-backed militias in Iraq have regularly attacked US facilities there.</li></ul><blockquote>We are deeply alarmed by the kidnapping of Al-Monitor contributor Shelly Kittleson in Iraq on Tuesday. We call for her safe and immediate release. - Al-Monitor</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Iraqi authorities: Iraqi officials said security forces were tracking the kidnappers and trying to recover Kittleson, showing that the state was actively responding to the abduction. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/u-s-journalist-kidnapped-in-baghdad-security-forces-tracking-down-captors-iraqi-officials-say'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>US State Department: US officials said they were aware of the case, linked one suspect to Kataib Hezbollah, and said Washington had already warned Kittleson about security threats in Iraq. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c5yled478zwo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Committee to Protect Journalists: The press-freedom group urged Iraqi authorities to use all available means to find Kittleson, secure her release, and hold those involved accountable. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/31/kidnapping-us-journalist-iraq-iranian-militants-00853116'>Politico</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/31/world/middleeast/us-journalist-abducted-iraq-shelly-kittleson.html'>US Journalist Shelly Kittleson Was Abducted in Iraq, Officials Say</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-journalist-kidnapped-in-baghdad-security-forces-hunt-captors-says-iraqi-officials/article70808827.ece'>U.S. journalist kidnapped in Baghdad, security forces hunt captors, say Iraqi officials</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/1/american-journalist-kidnapped-in-baghdad'>American journalist kidnapped in Baghdad</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c5yled478zwo'>US journalist Shelly Kittleson kidnapped in Baghdad</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/american-journalist-shelly-kittleson-ki